        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-07T15:50:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let\u0027s say apex_info_list returned `{A(is_active:true, is_factory:true, path\u003d/system/...)}` at step 1. `A` is not DCLA. There was a Mainline update for `A`, so the list gets updated to\n\n`{A(path\u003d/data/..., is_active:true,is_factory:false), A(path\u003d/system/..., is_active:false,is_factory:true)}`.\n\nAt step 3, let\u0027s assume that `A` was in the requested apex. Then both `A`s will added to the VM, though we don\u0027t want the is_factory version of A, right?",
      "parentUuid": "01fb2833_a93c96b0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 118,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 118,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "dfe8019772bba74a722b27a12c6bb64359dd77d3",
